---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About">
  <main>
    <div class="flex justify-center px-4">
      <div class="w-[1000px]">
        <div class="my-10">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-x-4">
            <div
              class="text-accent text-sm sm:text-md max-w-[600px] order-2 text-justify md:mt-0 mt-4"
            >
              <div>
                A frontend engineer by day and a tech enthusiast by night. Turning
                complex problems into clean, usable interfaces keeps me going.
              </div>
              <div class="my-2">Here's a quote I find inspiring</div>
              <span class="italic text-white"
                >"Start it messy, clean it up as you go, make it perfect later"</span
              >
              <br
              />&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp
              I try to follow this motto whenever I start procastinating.
              <div>
                When I'm not coding, you might find me diving into the latest
                tech trends, building custom PCs, or tinkering with new gadgets.
                I also like roaming around with my cycle.
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="order-1 sm:mt-0 mt-4">
              <img
                class="sm:w-48 sm:h-48 w-36 h-36 shrink-0"
                src="/pix-shifat.png"
                alt=""
              />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div
          class="text-accent font-jersey sm:text-4xl text-2xl my-5 text-center"
        >
          Working Experience
        </div>
        <div class="text-accent text-justify">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
            <div class="flex gap-x-2 items-center">
              <span class="font-jersey sm:text-3xl text-2xl text-white"
                >Brick Line Technology LTD</span
              >
            </div>
          </div>
          <div
            class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base"
          >
          <div class="flex gap-x-4">
            <div class="h-inherit pb-6">
              <div
                class="pixel mt-1.5 w-2 h-2 bg-accent"
              >
              </div>
              <div class="ml-0.5 mt-3 h-full border-l-4  border-accent border-opacity-20" />
            </div>
              <div class="">
                <div class=" gap-x-8">
                  <div class="flex justify-between">
                    <div>Frontend Engineer</div>
                    <div>Oct 2024 - Present</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class=" mt-2 border border-accent border-opacity-10"/>
                <div class="mt-2 text-muted sm:pl-4 pl-1">
                      <ul>
                        <li class="flex gap-x-2">
                          <span class="text-accent font-bold">-</span> Vue 2 to Vue 3 + Vuetify 3 migration on Zeda CTMS without disrupting production.
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex gap-x-2">
                          <span class="text-accent font-bold">-</span> Architected Playwright E2E test suite and configured Bitbucket Pipelines CI with diff-based lint, coverage gates, per-module test runs, and multi-environment deployment pipelines.
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex gap-x-2">
                          <span class="text-accent font-bold">-</span> Built e-signature PDF viewer with drag-and-drop field placement, and annotation PDF viewer with text highlighting and comment management (PDF.js).
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex gap-x-2">
                          <span class="text-accent font-bold">-</span> Built call assistant with call history, native audio player with transcript sync, segment-based timeline, and AI-powered call summary. Integrated Twilio voice calling.
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex gap-x-2">
                          <span class="text-accent font-bold">-</span> Integrated Google Location API for recruitment feature. Collaborated on full Zeda.ai homepage redesign with designer.
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex gap-x-2">
                          <span class="text-accent font-bold">-</span> Improved FluencyFirst Lighthouse score by 30% via lazy loading, render-blocking fixes, and LCP/CLS optimization. Built landing page from scratch, integrated GTM and Facebook Pixel.
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex gap-x-2">
                          <span class="text-accent font-bold">-</span> Mentored two interns through structured frontend onboarding.
                        </li>
                      </ul>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-8 flex justify-between items-center">
            <div class="flex gap-x-2 items-center">
              <span class="font-jersey sm:text-3xl text-2xl text-white"
                >Sayburgh Solutions</span
              >
              <a target="_blank" href="https://sayburgh.com/">
                <svg
                  fill="#A6EC61"
                  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                  x="0px"
                  y="0px"
                  width="25"
                  height="25"
                  viewBox="0 0 128 128"
                >
                  <path
                    d="M 84 11 C 82.3 11 81 12.3 81 14 C 81 15.7 82.3 17 84 17 L 106.80078 17 L 60.400391 63.400391 C 59.200391 64.600391 59.200391 66.499609 60.400391 67.599609 C 61.000391 68.199609 61.8 68.5 62.5 68.5 C 63.2 68.5 63.999609 68.199609 64.599609 67.599609 L 111 21.199219 L 111 44 C 111 45.7 112.3 47 114 47 C 115.7 47 117 45.7 117 44 L 117 14 C 117 12.3 115.7 11 114 11 L 84 11 z M 24 31 C 16.8 31 11 36.8 11 44 L 11 104 C 11 111.2 16.8 117 24 117 L 84 117 C 91.2 117 97 111.2 97 104 L 97 59 C 97 57.3 95.7 56 94 56 C 92.3 56 91 57.3 91 59 L 91 104 C 91 107.9 87.9 111 84 111 L 24 111 C 20.1 111 17 107.9 17 104 L 17 44 C 17 40.1 20.1 37 24 37 L 69 37 C 70.7 37 72 35.7 72 34 C 72 32.3 70.7 31 69 31 L 24 31 z"
                  ></path>
                </svg>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div
            class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base"
          >
            <div class="flex gap-x-4 ">
              <div class="h-inherit">
              <div
                class="pixel mt-1.5 w-2 h-2 bg-accent"
              >
              </div>
            </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between">
                      <div>Junior Frontend Developer</div>
                      <div>Nov 2022 - Sept 2024</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-2 h-inherit border border-left border-accent border-opacity-10"></div>
                    <div class="mt-2 text-muted text-sm sm:text-base sm:pl-4 pl-1">
                      <ul class="">
                        <li class="flex gap-x-2">
                          <span class="text-accent font-bold">-</span> Implemented dynamic payment methods, calculation logic and synced payment system with ordered items.
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex gap-x-2">
                          <span class="text-accent font-bold">-</span> Created role-based dynamic transaction table with date-range filtering, refund and print receipt options with custom pagination.
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex gap-x-2">
                          <span class="text-accent font-bold">-</span> Stored failed orders locally via IndexedDB and synced with backend through WebSocket.
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex gap-x-2">
                          <span class="text-accent font-bold">-</span> Implemented dynamic POS printing system (KOT, receipt, report printing).
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex gap-x-2">
                          <span class="text-accent font-bold">-</span> Worked on offline reservation system using IndexedDB.
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex gap-x-2">
                          <span class="text-accent font-bold">-</span> Implemented Vite-SSG with dynamic metadata for SEO.
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex gap-x-2">
                          <span class="text-accent font-bold">-</span> Bootstrapped 3 projects from scratch to deployment. Integrated APIs across 6 projects using Axios and GraphQL.
                        </li>
                      </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
<style scoped>
    .pixel {
      background-color: #a6ec61;
    box-shadow:
      inset 0.313em 0.313em 0 rgba(44, 121, 77, 0.4),
      inset -0.313em -0.313em 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.561);
    line-height: 17px;
    -webkit-animation: blink 2s step-end infinite;
    animation: blink 1s step-end infinite;
  }
</style>
